msgid ""
"The code on this page was developed using the following requirements.\n"
"We recommend using these versions or newer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kod pada halaman ini dibangunkan menggunakan keperluan berikut.\n"
"Kami mengesyorkan anda guna versi ini atau yang lebih baru.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"</details>\n"
"The steps in this topic describe how to run and configure workloads with the REST API, and demonstrate how to invoke them in any program of your choice.\n"
msgstr ""
"</details>\n"
"Langkah-langkah dalam topik ini menerangkan cara menjalankan dan mengkonfigurasi beban kerja dengan REST API, serta menunjukkan cara memanggilnya dalam mana-mana program pilihan anda.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"This documentation utilizes the Python `requests` module to demonstrate the Qiskit Runtime REST API. However, this workflow can be executed using any language or framework that supports working with REST APIs. Refer to the [API reference documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/tags/jobs) for details.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Dokumentasi ini menggunakan modul Python `requests` untuk mendemonstrasikan Qiskit Runtime REST API. Walau bagaimanapun, aliran kerja ini boleh dilaksanakan menggunakan sebarang bahasa atau rangka kerja yang menyokong REST API. Rujuk [dokumentasi rujukan API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/tags/jobs) untuk maklumat lanjut.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "1. Initialize the account {#1-initialize-the-account}"
msgstr "1. Mulakan akaun {#1-initialize-the-account}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Because Qiskit Runtime Estimator is a managed service, you first need to "
"initialize your account. You can then select the device you want to use to "
"calculate the expectation value.\n"
msgstr ""
"Oleh sebab Qiskit Runtime Estimator ialah perkhidmatan terurus, anda perlu "
"memulakan akaun anda dulu. Kemudian anda boleh pilih peranti yang nak "
"digunakan untuk mengira nilai jangkaan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Find details on how to initialize your account, view available backends, and"
" invalidate tokens in this [topic](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api).\n"
msgstr ""
"Cari butiran tentang cara memulakan akaun, melihat Backend yang tersedia, "
"dan membatalkan token dalam [topik](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api) ini.\n"

