#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "5. Work with Runtime options {#5-work-with-runtime-options}"
msgstr "5. Bekerja dengan pilihan Runtime {#5-work-with-runtime-options}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Error mitigation techniques allow users to mitigate circuit errors by "
"modeling the device noise at the time of execution. This typically results "
"in quantum pre-processing overhead related to model training, and classical "
"post-processing overhead to mitigate errors in the raw results by using the "
"generated model.\n"
msgstr ""
"Teknik pengurangan ralat membolehkan pengguna mengurangkan ralat Circuit "
"dengan memodelkan hingar peranti pada masa pelaksanaan. Ini biasanya "
"menghasilkan overhed pra-pemprosesan kuantum berkaitan latihan model, dan "
"overhed pasca-pemprosesan klasik untuk mengurangkan ralat dalam keputusan "
"mentah dengan menggunakan model yang dijana.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The error mitigation techniques built in to primitives are advanced "
"resilience options. To specify these options, use the `resilience_level` "
"option when submitting your job.\n"
msgstr ""
"Teknik pengurangan ralat yang terbina dalam primitif ialah pilihan "
"resilience lanjutan. Untuk menentukan pilihan ini, gunakan pilihan "
"`resilience_level` semasa menghantar kerja anda.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The following examples demonstrate the default options for dynamical "
"decoupling, twirling, and TREX + ZNE. Find more options and further details "
"in the [Error mitigation and suppression techniques](/guides/error-"
"mitigation-and-suppression-techniques) topic.\n"
msgstr ""
"Contoh-contoh berikut menunjukkan pilihan lalai untuk dynamical decoupling, "
"twirling, dan TREX + ZNE. Cari lebih banyak pilihan dan butiran lanjut dalam"
" topik [Teknik pengurangan dan penindasan ralat](/guides/error-mitigation-"
"and-suppression-techniques).\n"

