#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah seterusnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"- There are several ways to run workloads, depending on your needs: job mode, session mode, and batch mode. Learn how to work with session mode and batch mode in the [execution modes topic](/guides/execution-modes-rest-api). Note that Open Plan users cannot submit session jobs.\n"
"- Learn how to [initialize your account](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api) with REST API.\n"
"- Practice with primitives by working through the [Cost function lesson](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) in IBM Quantum&reg; Learning.\n"
"- Learn how to transpile locally in the [Transpile](/guides/transpile) section.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Cadangan\">\n"
"- Terdapat beberapa cara untuk menjalankan beban kerja, bergantung pada keperluan anda: mod kerja, mod Session, dan mod kelompok. Ketahui cara bekerja dengan mod Session dan mod kelompok dalam [topik mod pelaksanaan](/guides/execution-modes-rest-api). Perhatikan bahawa pengguna Pelan Terbuka tidak boleh menghantar kerja Session.\n"
"- Ketahui cara [memulakan akaun anda](/guides/cloud-setup-rest-api) dengan REST API.\n"
"- Berlatih dengan primitif melalui [pelajaran Fungsi kos](/learning/courses/variational-algorithm-design/cost-functions) dalam IBM Quantum&reg; Learning.\n"
"- Ketahui cara melakukan Transpiler secara tempatan dalam bahagian [Transpile](/guides/transpile).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
